WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.057 --> 00:00:04.738
Badger and Rat loved Mole's story.

2
00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:08.261
"What a clever trick!" said Rat.

3
00:00:08.262 --> 00:00:10.822
"Go on," said Badger.

4
00:00:10.823 --> 00:00:13.049
"Tell us more."

5
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.783
Mole continued.

6
00:00:15.784 --> 00:00:19.802
"A ferret told me to leave," Mole said.

7
00:00:19.803 --> 00:00:23.936
"'Now go away, good woman!' the ferret said."

8
00:00:23.937 --> 00:00:29.660
"They called you 'good woman'?" laughed Badger.

9
00:00:29.661 --> 00:00:34.602
"How funny!" cried Rat, holding his stomach.

10
00:00:34.603 --> 00:00:37.700
Toad looked away.

11
00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:41.498
"I wore the dress too," he mumbled.

12
00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:44.363
"Someone called me 'good woman.'

13
00:00:44.364 --> 00:00:48.251
But no one laughed at [i@my@i] story!"

14
00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:50.375
Mole continued:

15
00:00:50.376 --> 00:00:54.366
"'Don't bother us!' a ferret yelled.

16
00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:56.259
'Go away!'

17
00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:00.624
'Soon [i@you@i] will have to go, sir!' I said."

18
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:04.467
"Oh, Mole, you said that?" asked Rat.

19
00:01:04.468 --> 00:01:07.209
"They will figure out our plan!"

20
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:10.852
"Let Mole finish," said Badger.

21
00:01:10.853 --> 00:01:13.273
Mole went on:

22
00:01:13.274 --> 00:01:16.797
"The ferrets all looked at each other.

23
00:01:16.798 --> 00:01:20.507
'Don't listen to her!' one ferret said.

24
00:01:20.508 --> 00:01:24.619
'She's just an old woman,' said another.

25
00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:28.294
And I said, 'Maybe you should listen.

26
00:01:28.295 --> 00:01:32.081
My daughter does wash for Mr. Badger.

27
00:01:32.082 --> 00:01:35.389
And she heard him making a plan.

28
00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:40.470
Tonight there will be a great attack!'"

29
00:01:40.471 --> 00:01:43.472
Mole's friends were shocked.

30
00:01:43.473 --> 00:01:46.495
They all looked at each other.

31
00:01:46.496 --> 00:01:51.152
"What has Mole done?" Rat thought.

